config CASCADIA_EXPERIMENTAL_NATIVE_CLOCK
	bool "Source-only P105 native host clock broker experiment"
	depends on ARM && REGMAP
	default n
	help
	  Compile checked P105 12H321 host87/89 clock graph primitives only.
	  No clock provider, platform probe, DT binding or role is registered.
	  Activation requires externally proven adoption of every global owner,
	  inherited references, physical state and power policy. Those bindings
	  are unresolved; this experiment supplies no activation path.
